###

### Create a sample Finance Team role group (replace roleIds with existing role IDs)
POST {{ERP.WorkflowwServices.API_HostAddress}}/api/role-groups
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": null,
  "groupName": "Finance Team",
  "groupCode": "FINANCE_TEAM",
  "description": "Finance roles available for workflow participation.",
  "departmentId": null,
  "remarks": null,
  "isActive": true,
  "roleIds": [
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"
  ]
}

###

### Update a role group (replace IDs with an existing group and role)
PUT {{ERP.WorkflowwServices.API_HostAddress}}/api/role-groups/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": null,
  "groupName": "Finance Team",
  "groupCode": "FINANCE_TEAM",
  "description": "Finance roles available for workflow participation.",
  "departmentId": null,
  "remarks": null,
