###

### List permissions
GET {{ERP.WorkflowwServices.API_HostAddress}}/api/permissions?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20&status=0&sortField=permissionName&sortOrder=asc
Accept: application/json

###

### Get supported permission types
GET {{ERP.WorkflowwServices.API_HostAddress}}/api/permissions/types
Accept: application/json

###

### Get active permissions
GET {{ERP.WorkflowwServices.API_HostAddress}}/api/permissions/dropdown
Accept: application/json

###

### Get permission details (replace with an existing permission ID)
GET {{ERP.WorkflowwServices.API_HostAddress}}/api/permissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a permission (replace moduleId with an active module ID)
POST {{ERP.WorkflowwServices.API_HostAddress}}/api/permissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "moduleId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "subModuleId": null,
  "menuId": null,
  "permissionName": "View Purchase Requisition",
  "permissionKey": "PURCHASE.REQUISITION.VIEW",
  "permissionType": "View",
  "description": "View purchase requisitions.",
  "sortOrder": 0,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Update a permission (replace IDs with existing values)
PUT {{ERP.WorkflowwServices.API_HostAddress}}/api/permissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "moduleId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "subModuleId": null,
  "menuId": null,
  "permissionName": "View Purchase Requisition",
  "permissionKey": "PURCHASE.REQUISITION.VIEW",
  "permissionType": "View",
  "description": "View purchase requisitions.",
  "sortOrder": 0,
  "isActive": true
}

