### Archive a permission
PATCH {{ERP.WorkflowwServices.API_HostAddress}}/api/permissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/archive

###

### Restore a permission
PATCH {{ERP.WorkflowwServices.API_HostAddress}}/api/permissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/unarchive

