###

### Get roles available for permission mapping
GET {{ERP.WorkflowwServices.API_HostAddress}}/api/role-permissions/roles
Accept: application/json

###

### Get active permission hierarchy
GET {{ERP.WorkflowwServices.API_HostAddress}}/api/role-permissions/permissions/tree
Accept: application/json

###

### Load a role's permission state
GET {{ERP.WorkflowwServices.API_HostAddress}}/api/role-permissions/role/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

###

### Save full mapping (include one state for every active permission returned by the role endpoint)
PUT {{ERP.WorkflowwServices.API_HostAddress}}/api/role-permissions/role/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "permissions": [
    {
      "permissionId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "isGranted": true
    },
    {
      "permissionId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
      "isGranted": false
    }
  ]
}

###

### Get the authorization-scoped user dashboard
GET {{ERP.WorkflowwServices.API_HostAddress}}/api/user-dashboard?fromDate=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&toDate=2026-02-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

